        "text_jKVR6a": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The hemp industry has a trust problem. Because cannabinoid supplements are not held to the same regulatory standards as pharmaceuticals, label accuracy, contaminant screening, and potency verification vary wildly from brand to brand. The FDA has documented cases of products containing less CBD than advertised, undisclosed THC, or detectable levels of heavy metals and pesticides. </p><p>We built Hemplucid to be the exception. Every product we sell is subjected to independent, third-party laboratory testing before it reaches your hands. Not a spot check. Not a sample. Every batch, every time. That standard applies to every formula we make, including our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/full-spectrum-whole-plant-cbd\" target=\"_blank\">lab tested full spectrum CBD</a> and our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/pets-cbd\" target=\"_blank\">lab-tested pet CBD products</a>. And we give you the tools to verify it yourself.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
